Renders the content of the Circuit and Order tabs (CircuitPanel.tsx and OrderPanel.tsx in apps/web/src/tscircuit/, loaded lazily). The Circuit tab gets the thread's composer target so its "Add to prompt" can write to the prompt. Both get the thread: the Circuit tab opens the Order tab in its panel, and the Order tab keeps its choice of file there.

